{"seq":3,"slug":"data-driven-state-config","title":"数据驱动状态配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/advanced/data-driven-state-config","wordCount":674,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据驱动状态配置\">数据驱动状态配置</h1><p>数据驱动状态配置（Data-Driven State Configuration）将状态机的定义从代码中分离出来，以 JSON、ScriptableObject 或其他数据格式描述状态、转换和参数，在运行时动态加载并构建状态机。这让策划可以不修改代码地调整 NPC 行为，也使多个 NPC 变体共享相同的状态机框架但有不同的参数成为可能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据驱动状态配置的本质是<strong>将「状态机的结构」与「执行引擎」分离</strong>：执行引擎是通用的代码，状态机结构由数据文件定义。这与传统方式（状态机结构硬编码在类中）的区别是：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>硬编码状态机</th>\n<th>数据驱动状态机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>添加新状态</td>\n<td>修改代码，重新编译</td>\n<td>修改配置文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策划调参</td>\n<td>需要程序员介入</td>\n<td>策划直接编辑数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多变体 NPC</td>\n<td>复制类，维护多份代码</td>\n<td>多份配置文件，同一引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热重载</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>可以在运行时重载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试可视化</td>\n<td>依赖代码实现</td>\n<td>可基于数据文件生成图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数据驱动架构流程\">数据驱动架构流程</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[JSON / SO 配置文件] --&gt; B[StateMachineBuilder\\n解析器]&#10;    B --&gt; C[RuntimeFSM\\n执行引擎]&#10;    C --&gt; D[游戏对象]&#10;    E[文件监听器] --&gt; |文件变更| B&#10;    F[Blackboard\\n共享数据] &lt;--&gt; C&#10;    G[ActionRegistry\\n行动注册表] --&gt; B&#10;    H[ConditionParser\\n条件解析器] --&gt; B\">flowchart LR\n    A[JSON / SO 配置文件] --&gt; B[StateMachineBuilder\\n解析器]\n    B --&gt; C[RuntimeFSM\\n执行引擎]\n    C --&gt; D[游戏对象]\n    E[文件监听器] --&gt; |文件变更| B\n    F[Blackboard\\n共享数据] &lt;--&gt; C\n    G[ActionRegistry\\n行动注册表] --&gt; B\n    H[ConditionParser\\n条件解析器] --&gt; B</pre><p>数据驱动架构的核心层次：配置文件描述结构，解析器将配置转换为运行时对象，执行引擎驱动游戏对象行为，文件监听器实现热重载。</p>\n<h2 id=\"json-格式状态配置\">JSON 格式状态配置</h2><p>一个完整的 JSON 状态机定义示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;BasicEnemyFSM&quot;,&#10;  &quot;initialState&quot;: &quot;Patrol&quot;,&#10;  &quot;blackboardDefaults&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;alertLevel&quot;: 0.0,&#10;    &quot;lastKnownPlayerPos&quot;: null,&#10;    &quot;healthPercent&quot;: 1.0&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;states&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Patrol&quot;,&#10;      &quot;onEnter&quot;: [&quot;PlayAnimation:Patrol_Walk&quot;, &quot;SetNavSpeed:2.0&quot;],&#10;      &quot;onExit&quot;: [&quot;StopAnimation&quot;],&#10;      &quot;transitions&quot;: [&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;to&quot;: &quot;Alert&quot;,&#10;          &quot;condition&quot;: &quot;alertLevel &gt; 0.3&quot;,&#10;          &quot;priority&quot;: 10&#10;        }&#10;      ]&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Alert&quot;,&#10;      &quot;onEnter&quot;: [&quot;PlaySound:alert_sound&quot;, &quot;SetNavSpeed:1.5&quot;],&#10;      &quot;onExit&quot;: [],&#10;      &quot;transitions&quot;: [&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;to&quot;: &quot;Chase&quot;,&#10;          &quot;condition&quot;: &quot;alertLevel &gt; 0.8&quot;,&#10;          &quot;priority&quot;: 10&#10;        },&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;to&quot;: &quot;Patrol&quot;,&#10;          &quot;condition&quot;: &quot;alertLevel &lt; 0.1 &amp;&amp; stateTime &gt; 3.0&quot;,&#10;          &quot;priority&quot;: 5&#10;        }&#10;      ]&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Chase&quot;,&#10;      &quot;onEnter&quot;: [&quot;PlayAnimation:Run&quot;, &quot;SetNavSpeed:4.5&quot;],&#10;      &quot;onExit&quot;: [],&#10;      &quot;transitions&quot;: [&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;to&quot;: &quot;Attack&quot;,&#10;          &quot;condition&quot;: &quot;distanceToPlayer &lt; 2.0&quot;,&#10;          &quot;priority&quot;: 10&#10;        }&#10;      ]&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BasicEnemyFSM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"initialState\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Patrol\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"blackboardDefaults\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"alertLevel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lastKnownPlayerPos\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"healthPercent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"states\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Patrol\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"onEnter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PlayAnimation:Patrol_Walk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SetNavSpeed:2.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"onExit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"StopAnimation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"transitions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"condition\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alertLevel > 0.3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"onEnter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PlaySound:alert_sound\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SetNavSpeed:1.5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"onExit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"transitions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Chase\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"condition\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alertLevel > 0.8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Patrol\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"condition\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alertLevel &#x3C; 0.1 &#x26;&#x26; stateTime > 3.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Chase\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"onEnter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PlayAnimation:Run\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SetNavSpeed:4.5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"onExit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"transitions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Attack\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"condition\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"distanceToPlayer &#x3C; 2.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"配置解析器\">配置解析器</h2><p>将 JSON 配置解析并构建运行时状态机：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"[Serializable]&#10;public class StateMachineConfig&#10;{&#10;    public string name;&#10;    public string initialState;&#10;    public Dictionary&lt;string, object&gt; blackboardDefaults;&#10;    public List&lt;StateConfig&gt; states;&#10;}&#10;&#10;[Serializable]&#10;public class StateConfig&#10;{&#10;    public string name;&#10;    public List&lt;string&gt; onEnter;&#10;    public List&lt;string&gt; onExit;&#10;    public List&lt;TransitionConfig&gt; transitions;&#10;}&#10;&#10;[Serializable]&#10;public class TransitionConfig&#10;{&#10;    public string to;&#10;    public string condition;  // 表达式字符串&#10;    public int priority;&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class StateMachineBuilder&#10;{&#10;    private ActionRegistry actionRegistry;&#10;    private ConditionParser conditionParser;&#10;&#10;    public RuntimeFSM Build(StateMachineConfig config, GameObject owner)&#10;    {&#10;        var fsm = new RuntimeFSM(config.name);&#10;        var blackboard = BuildBlackboard(config.blackboardDefaults);&#10;&#10;        foreach (var stateConfig in config.states)&#10;        {&#10;            var state = BuildState(stateConfig, owner, blackboard);&#10;            fsm.AddState(state);&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        fsm.Initialize(config.initialState, blackboard);&#10;        return fsm;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private RuntimeState BuildState(&#10;        StateConfig config,&#10;        GameObject owner,&#10;        Blackboard blackboard)&#10;    {&#10;        var state = new RuntimeState(config.name);&#10;&#10;        // 解析 onEnter 行动&#10;        foreach (var actionStr in config.onEnter)&#10;        {&#10;            var action = actionRegistry.Parse(actionStr, owner);&#10;            state.AddEnterAction(action);&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        // 解析转换条件&#10;        foreach (var transConfig in config.transitions)&#10;        {&#10;            var condition = conditionParser.Compile(&#10;                transConfig.condition, blackboard);&#10;            state.AddTransition(new RuntimeTransition(&#10;                transConfig.to, condition, transConfig.priority));&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        return state;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[Serializable]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class StateMachineConfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string initialState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Dictionary&#x3C;string, object> blackboardDefaults;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public List&#x3C;StateConfig> states;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Serializable]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class StateConfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public List&#x3C;string> onEnter;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public List&#x3C;string> onExit;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public List&#x3C;TransitionConfig> transitions;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Serializable]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class TransitionConfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string to;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string condition;  // 表达式字符串</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public int priority;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class StateMachineBuilder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private ActionRegistry actionRegistry;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private ConditionParser conditionParser;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public RuntimeFSM Build(StateMachineConfig config, GameObject owner)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var fsm = new RuntimeFSM(config.name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var blackboard = BuildBlackboard(config.blackboardDefaults);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var stateConfig in config.states)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            var state = BuildState(stateConfig, owner, blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            fsm.AddState(state);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fsm.Initialize(config.initialState, blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return fsm;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private RuntimeState BuildState(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        StateConfig config,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameObject owner,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Blackboard blackboard)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var state = new RuntimeState(config.name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 解析 onEnter 行动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var actionStr in config.onEnter)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            var action = actionRegistry.Parse(actionStr, owner);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            state.AddEnterAction(action);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 解析转换条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var transConfig in config.transitions)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            var condition = conditionParser.Compile(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                transConfig.condition, blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            state.AddTransition(new RuntimeTransition(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                transConfig.to, condition, transConfig.priority));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return state;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"unity-scriptableobject-方案\">Unity ScriptableObject 方案</h2><p>在 Unity 中，ScriptableObject 是数据驱动配置的原生方案，比 JSON 有更好的编辑器支持：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 状态配置 ScriptableObject&#10;[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = &quot;FSM/State Config&quot;)]&#10;public class StateConfigSO : ScriptableObject&#10;{&#10;    public string stateName;&#10;    public AnimationClip enterAnimation;&#10;    public float moveSpeed = 2f;&#10;    public List&lt;TransitionConfigSO&gt; transitions;&#10;&#10;    [Header(&quot;自定义行为&quot;)]&#10;    public List&lt;StateActionSO&gt; enterActions;&#10;    public List&lt;StateActionSO&gt; updateActions;&#10;    public List&lt;StateActionSO&gt; exitActions;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 转换配置&#10;[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = &quot;FSM/Transition Config&quot;)]&#10;public class TransitionConfigSO : ScriptableObject&#10;{&#10;    public StateConfigSO targetState;&#10;    public ConditionSO condition;&#10;    public int priority = 5;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 抽象条件基类（可按需扩展）&#10;public abstract class ConditionSO : ScriptableObject&#10;{&#10;    public abstract bool Evaluate(FSMContext context);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 具体条件实现&#10;[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = &quot;FSM/Conditions/Distance Check&quot;)]&#10;public class DistanceCheckCondition : ConditionSO&#10;{&#10;    public string targetBlackboardKey = &quot;PlayerTransform&quot;;&#10;    public float maxDistance = 5f;&#10;&#10;    public override bool Evaluate(FSMContext context)&#10;    {&#10;        var target = context.Blackboard.Get&lt;Transform&gt;(targetBlackboardKey);&#10;        if (target == null) return false;&#10;        return Vector3.Distance(context.Owner.transform.position,&#10;            target.position) &lt;= maxDistance;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 状态配置 ScriptableObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = \"FSM/State Config\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class StateConfigSO : ScriptableObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string stateName;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public AnimationClip enterAnimation;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float moveSpeed = 2f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public List&#x3C;TransitionConfigSO> transitions;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Header(\"自定义行为\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public List&#x3C;StateActionSO> enterActions;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public List&#x3C;StateActionSO> updateActions;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public List&#x3C;StateActionSO> exitActions;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 转换配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = \"FSM/Transition Config\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class TransitionConfigSO : ScriptableObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public StateConfigSO targetState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public ConditionSO condition;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public int priority = 5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 抽象条件基类（可按需扩展）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public abstract class ConditionSO : ScriptableObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public abstract bool Evaluate(FSMContext context);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 具体条件实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = \"FSM/Conditions/Distance Check\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class DistanceCheckCondition : ConditionSO</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string targetBlackboardKey = \"PlayerTransform\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float maxDistance = 5f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override bool Evaluate(FSMContext context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var target = context.Blackboard.Get&#x3C;Transform>(targetBlackboardKey);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (target == null) return false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Vector3.Distance(context.Owner.transform.position,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            target.position) &#x3C;= maxDistance;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"热重载实现\">热重载实现</h2><p>热重载允许在游戏运行时修改配置文件并立即生效，大幅提升迭代效率：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class HotReloadableFSMLoader : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private string configFilePath;&#10;    private FileSystemWatcher fileWatcher;&#10;    private RuntimeFSM activeFSM;&#10;    private StateMachineBuilder builder;&#10;&#10;    private void Start()&#10;    {&#10;        LoadAndBuildFSM();&#10;        SetupFileWatcher();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void SetupFileWatcher()&#10;    {&#10;        fileWatcher = new FileSystemWatcher(&#10;            Path.GetDirectoryName(configFilePath))&#10;        {&#10;            Filter = Path.GetFileName(configFilePath),&#10;            NotifyFilter = NotifyFilters.LastWrite&#10;        };&#10;&#10;        fileWatcher.Changed += OnConfigFileChanged;&#10;        fileWatcher.EnableRaisingEvents = true;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private volatile bool needsReload = false;&#10;&#10;    private void OnConfigFileChanged(object sender, FileSystemEventArgs e)&#10;    {&#10;        // 文件系统事件在非主线程触发，设置标志在主线程处理&#10;        needsReload = true;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void Update()&#10;    {&#10;        if (needsReload)&#10;        {&#10;            needsReload = false;&#10;            ReloadFSM();&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        activeFSM?.Update();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void ReloadFSM()&#10;    {&#10;        string currentState = activeFSM?.CurrentStateName;&#10;&#10;        LoadAndBuildFSM();&#10;&#10;        // 尽量恢复到重载前的状态&#10;        if (currentState != null &amp;&amp; activeFSM.HasState(currentState))&#10;            activeFSM.ForceSetState(currentState);&#10;&#10;        Debug.Log($&quot;[FSM] Hot-reloaded: now in {activeFSM?.CurrentStateName}&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void LoadAndBuildFSM()&#10;    {&#10;        string json = File.ReadAllText(configFilePath);&#10;        var config = JsonUtility.FromJson&lt;StateMachineConfig&gt;(json);&#10;        activeFSM = builder.Build(config, gameObject);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class HotReloadableFSMLoader : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private string configFilePath;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private FileSystemWatcher fileWatcher;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private RuntimeFSM activeFSM;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private StateMachineBuilder builder;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Start()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        LoadAndBuildFSM();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        SetupFileWatcher();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void SetupFileWatcher()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fileWatcher = new FileSystemWatcher(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Path.GetDirectoryName(configFilePath))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Filter = Path.GetFileName(configFilePath),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            NotifyFilter = NotifyFilters.LastWrite</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fileWatcher.Changed += OnConfigFileChanged;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fileWatcher.EnableRaisingEvents = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private volatile bool needsReload = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnConfigFileChanged(object sender, FileSystemEventArgs e)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 文件系统事件在非主线程触发，设置标志在主线程处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        needsReload = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Update()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (needsReload)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            needsReload = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ReloadFSM();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        activeFSM?.Update();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void ReloadFSM()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        string currentState = activeFSM?.CurrentStateName;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        LoadAndBuildFSM();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 尽量恢复到重载前的状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (currentState != null &#x26;&#x26; activeFSM.HasState(currentState))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            activeFSM.ForceSetState(currentState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Debug.Log($\"[FSM] Hot-reloaded: now in {activeFSM?.CurrentStateName}\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void LoadAndBuildFSM()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        string json = File.ReadAllText(configFilePath);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var config = JsonUtility.FromJson&#x3C;StateMachineConfig>(json);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        activeFSM = builder.Build(config, gameObject);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"可视化编辑器\">可视化编辑器</h2><p>数据驱动的终极形态是可视化状态机编辑器，让策划通过拖拽连线编辑状态逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 编辑器工具：从 JSON 生成状态机可视图（Unity Editor 扩展）&#10;#if UNITY_EDITOR&#10;public class FSMVisualizerWindow : EditorWindow&#10;{&#10;    private StateMachineConfig config;&#10;    private Dictionary&lt;string, Rect&gt; stateRects&#10;        = new Dictionary&lt;string, Rect&gt;();&#10;&#10;    private void OnGUI()&#10;    {&#10;        // 绘制状态节点&#10;        foreach (var state in config.states)&#10;        {&#10;            if (!stateRects.ContainsKey(state.name))&#10;                stateRects[state.name] = new Rect(&#10;                    Random.Range(50, 400), Random.Range(50, 300), 120, 40);&#10;&#10;            GUI.Box(stateRects[state.name], state.name);&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        // 绘制转换箭头&#10;        foreach (var state in config.states)&#10;        {&#10;            foreach (var trans in state.transitions)&#10;            {&#10;                if (stateRects.TryGetValue(state.name, out var fromRect)&#10;                    &amp;&amp; stateRects.TryGetValue(trans.to, out var toRect))&#10;                {&#10;                    DrawArrow(fromRect.center, toRect.center, trans.condition);&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void DrawArrow(Vector2 from, Vector2 to, string label)&#10;    {&#10;        Handles.DrawLine(from, to);&#10;        // 绘制箭头头部和条件标签&#10;        GUI.Label(new Rect(&#10;            (from.x + to.x) / 2, (from.y + to.y) / 2, 200, 20), label);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;#endif\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 编辑器工具：从 JSON 生成状态机可视图（Unity Editor 扩展）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#if UNITY_EDITOR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class FSMVisualizerWindow : EditorWindow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private StateMachineConfig config;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Dictionary&#x3C;string, Rect> stateRects</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        = new Dictionary&#x3C;string, Rect>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnGUI()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 绘制状态节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var state in config.states)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (!stateRects.ContainsKey(state.name))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                stateRects[state.name] = new Rect(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    Random.Range(50, 400), Random.Range(50, 300), 120, 40);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            GUI.Box(stateRects[state.name], state.name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 绘制转换箭头</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var state in config.states)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            foreach (var trans in state.transitions)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (stateRects.TryGetValue(state.name, out var fromRect)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    &#x26;&#x26; stateRects.TryGetValue(trans.to, out var toRect))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    DrawArrow(fromRect.center, toRect.center, trans.condition);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void DrawArrow(Vector2 from, Vector2 to, string label)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Handles.DrawLine(from, to);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 绘制箭头头部和条件标签</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GUI.Label(new Rect(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            (from.x + to.x) / 2, (from.y + to.y) / 2, 200, 20), label);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#endif</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>数据驱动状态配置将「状态机的结构」从代码中解放出来，让策划能够直接编辑 NPC 行为，实现热重载以加速迭代，支持多变体 NPC 共享框架。实现路径：JSON（轻量、可版本控制）→ ScriptableObject（Unity 原生、编辑器集成）→ 可视化编辑器（最高效但开发成本最高）。选择粒度取决于项目规模和策划需要的控制权。</p>\n<p><strong>同章节其他内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"pushdown-automata\">下推自动机与状态栈</a> — 数据驱动的栈式状态管理</li>\n<li><a href=\"concurrent-state-machines\">并发状态机</a> — 多区域的数据驱动配置可进一步扩展本文方案</li>\n<li><a href=\"../fundamentals/state-machine-implementation\">状态机实现策略</a> — 数据驱动是表驱动策略的自然延伸</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据驱动状态配置","id":"数据驱动状态配置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"数据驱动架构流程","id":"数据驱动架构流程"},{"level":2,"text":"JSON 格式状态配置","id":"json-格式状态配置"},{"level":2,"text":"配置解析器","id":"配置解析器"},{"level":2,"text":"Unity ScriptableObject 方案","id":"unity-scriptableobject-方案"},{"level":2,"text":"热重载实现","id":"热重载实现"},{"level":2,"text":"可视化编辑器","id":"可视化编辑器"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"并发状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/advanced/concurrent-state-machines"},"next":null}